            "notes": "At this point you still evaluate the situation.  [Iaido Strike](item_0b4def91-53c9-4bb7-b706-05aff6e4b168) scales with both ap and wp. You either go full damage if u can get away with it with the enemies or you build defence for the sole reason to stay alive longer to farm.\n\n [Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643) is an intresting choice. If i have slow healers and I need to initiate, i get it for the dash blade escape poke.\n\nArmor is armor. Ap is Ap.",
