        {
            "id": "9b7d69cf-adcd-4ab3-bfd1-66ba07d55c1d",
            "build_id": "c0f6de76-1f27-4aac-b8a9-d35eb166b5c2",
            "round_number": 3,
            "cash_earned": 0,
            "created_at": "2025-08-01T03:04:56.804701+00:00",
            "notes": "[Hanamura Healing](item_d210417d-1e30-4571-a4f3-cccd1dfc23ca) is my go to usually for the reason of knowing that i ll get no defensive items. So this is like my 7th defensive item giving me that small edge to stay alive. Usually when you dive in you get insta damaged by many small sources. Orbs coach guns etc.\n\n [Dragon's Breath](item_32dc8374-7541-46fb-9891-29b7fbe9ed4d) is somethin i rarely pick, the reason I pick it is when i know they are super grouped and my team dives with me usually. I think it like a range extension for my  [Iaido Strike](item_0b4def91-53c9-4bb7-b706-05aff6e4b168) swing.\n\n [Deflect-O-Bot](item_698a6929-22b8-4c39-95d8-43792d126c10) is another common pick for me. If i know they don't run a moira or other forms of poke collateral damage and i can spend some time deflecting i can might  [Hanamura Healing](item_d210417d-1e30-4571-a4f3-cccd1dfc23ca) . I pick this to counter characters like freja and cass, and the reason is that i simply does on them and insta pop deflect, everything coming on my direction just pops on them with aim bot accuracy.\n\n [Hashimoto\u2019s Bane](item_03650ff3-917e-45fe-aeed-11c0f24c0eba) is more like a gimmick skill for fast and easy triggering  [Mark of the Kitsune](item_09a53e39-25aa-4f66-ba51-bedbc543a1eb) .. it just makes it easy mode. \n\nAt this point at the game you should sell everything and go full glass cannon. The Ap breakpoint is around 75-85% imo. For my playstyle there is no other answer than getting more damage. \n\n# Disclaimer\nThere will be games you will have to evaluate you are the sole threat on your team and the enemies will focus you, counterbuild and only put effort on you. If they do all this you can't go full glass cannon. You will have to play around stayin alive and being annoying. Aka making space (profit?).",
